cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the article listed under preferred-citation."
title: "Segmented Multimodal Textualization for Educational Video Understanding"
abstract: >-
  Training-free pipeline that converts long videos into time-ordered text segments
  by combining BLIP-base frame captions with Whisper-base transcripts, including
  the speech-anchored frame sampling rule and the fusion stage, so that a
  general-purpose language model can answer questions about the video and
  summarize it.
